{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 30,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Unity Through Humility"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " any "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or encouragement"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "consolation in Christ, if any comfort of love, if any fellowship of the Spirit, if any affection and mercy, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fulfill my joy by being like-minded, having the same love, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "being"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of one accord, of one mind. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Let"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " nothing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be done"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " through selfish ambition or conceit, but in lowliness of mind let each esteem others better than himself. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let each of you look out not only for his own interests, but also for the interests of others."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Humbled and Exalted Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let this mind be in you which was also in Christ Jesus, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who, being in the form of God, did not consider it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or something to be held onto to be equal"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "robbery to be equal with God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "emptied Himself of His privileges"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "made Himself of no reputation, taking the form of a bondservant, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " coming in the likeness of men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And being found in appearance as a man, He humbled Himself and became obedient to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the point of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " death, even the death of the cross. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore God also has highly exalted Him and given Him the name which is above every name, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that at the name of Jesus every knee should bow, of those in heaven, and of those on earth, and of those under the earth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " every tongue should confess that Jesus Christ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Lord, to the glory of God the Father."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Light Bearers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, my beloved, as you have always obeyed, not as in my presence only, but now much more in my absence, work out your own salvation with fear and trembling; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for it is God who works in you both to will and to do for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good pleasure."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do all things without "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "grumbling"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "complaining and disputing,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arguing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that you may become blameless and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "innocent"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "harmless, children of God without fault in the midst of a crooked and perverse generation, among whom you shine as lights in the world, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "holding fast the word of life, so that I may rejoice in the day of Christ that I have not run in vain or labored in vain."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yes, and if I am being poured out "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as a drink offering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the sacrifice and service of your faith, I am glad and rejoice with you all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the same reason you also be glad and rejoice with me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Timothy Commended"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I trust in the Lord Jesus to send Timothy to you shortly, that I also may be encouraged when I know your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "condition"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "state. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I have no one like-minded, who will sincerely care for your state. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For all seek their own, not the things which are of Christ Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you know his proven character, that as a son with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " father he served with me in the gospel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I hope to send him at once, as soon as I see how it goes with me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I trust in the Lord that I myself shall also come shortly."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Epaphroditus Praised"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet I considered it necessary to send to you Epaphroditus, my brother, fellow worker, and fellow soldier, but your messenger and the one who ministered to my need; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "since he was longing for you all, and was distressed because you had heard that he was sick. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For indeed he was sick almost unto death; but God had mercy on him, and not only on him but on me also, lest I should have sorrow upon sorrow. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I sent him the more eagerly, that when you see him again you may rejoice, and I may be less sorrowful. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Receive him therefore in the Lord with all gladness, and hold such men in esteem; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "because for the work of Christ he came close to death, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "risking"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "not regarding his life, to supply what was lacking in your service toward me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}